OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in crash after police
OL,4,Apursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died and two women have been
OL,7,Finjured in a crash after a police
OL,8,Fpursuit near Stratford-upon-Avon.
OL,10,FOfficers tried to stop a black Audi on
OL,11,FBirmingham Road shortly before 17:30
OL,12,FBST on Monday but the driver failed to
OL,13,Fpull over, Warwickshire Police said.
OL,15,FA pursuit began and 15 minutes later
OL,16,Fthe Audi crashed into a white Ford
OL,17,FPuma, the force added, with the Audi's
OL,18,F19-year-old male driver confirmed dead
OL,19,Fat the scene by paramedics.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
